{"author":{"id":"dec876858d28babbadcead4137861bf586626b8518cbce9c5f4fc52ac3b424b8"},"ops":[{"type":1,"timestamp":1795823100,"nonce":"8/87L8sgyBNtLgjxiqqK3Q03QhA=","title":"LayerConfig::new() has an opacity of 0, so a layer built from it draws nothing","message":"`LayerConfig` derives `Default`, which gives `opacity: 0.0`. `new()` returns it\nand is documented as creating a config with default values.\n`push_layer(LayerConfig { blend_mode: BlendMode::Screen, ..LayerConfig::new() })`\ndraws nothing. Every caller in the tree sets the opacity.\n\nFix: implement `Default` with an opacity of 1.","files":null}]}